{
 "name": "AWP",
 "_comment": "Transcription of src/bl2_blender/awp_retarget.py (M9-M11): the CS2 AWP onto the Jakobs sniper gestalt. Bone map measured by anim_probe (M11): bolt_action -> Jakobs_VarA_BackSlider moves 4.6 u straight back on fire; Clip is static through a reload so the magazine stays on Root; never bind to Jakobs_Chamber/Jakobs_Rounds (111.8 deg). The glb is not redistributable and never enters the repo.",
